+//    entry with the same URL not mapped to another live tab (open ones first),
+//    else add a new top-level entry; mark it open; align its order with the
+//    tab strip.
+//  - unpin: remove the entry (pinned and bookmark are the same element).
+//  - move: align the entry order with the neighbouring pinned tabs.
+//  - committed URL change: update the entry URL.
+//  - close by the user: keep the entry, clear `open` (closed pinned).
+//  - close of the whole window or quit: keep the entry and `open`, so the
+//    next startup reopens it.
+//  - entry removed elsewhere (bookmark manager, Sync): the tab stays pinned
+//    and unmapped; nothing is recreated until the tab is pinned again or
+//    navigates.
